SUMMARY:Lunch & Learn: Why System Design Is So Critical With AI and How to
  Learn It
DESCRIPTION:All Things AI (Live)\nJudgment is the scarce skill\, you guard
  the one-way doors\, and you learn it with Claude as a tutor.\n\nAI system
  design is reasoning about how a system behaves under load\, scales\, fail
 s\, and changes over time\, which is the architectural judgment that count
 s more now that AI writes the code. It is the skill that separates juniors
  from operators. This discussion will focus on building those skills and l
 everaging them for proper system design.\n\nThis is for software engineers
  typically with some production experience but could be of interest to eme
 rging developers as well.
