SUMMARY:All Things AI Happy Hour at Boxyard RTP
DESCRIPTION:All Things AI (Live)\nNo slides. No sales pitches. Just good f
 ood\, a cold drink\, and a people learning AI together.\n\nAll Things AI i
 s taking the community out of the conference room and into Boxyard RTP\, t
 he shipping-container village in the middle of Research Triangle Park. Whe
 ther you've never opened ChatGPT or you ship agents for a living\, you bel
 ong here. Nobody's too new\, and nobody's too senior. That's the whole poi
 nt.\n\n**Why come**\n\n* Meet the builders\, career-changers and curious p
 eople behind the Triangle's biggest AI community\n* Swap notes on what's a
 ctually working\, and find the person who already solved the problem you'r
 e stuck on\n* Leave with a few new people you'll be texting next week\n\nI
 t's Halloween week\, so costumes are optional but very much encouraged.\n\
 n**Bring a friend.** A coworker\, a classmate\, or the person at your comp
 any who keeps asking you about AI. Food and drinks are available from the 
 Boxyard vendors (pay your own way).
